        "speakerCharacterId": "system",
        "speakerName": "系统",
        "text": "床下确实很窄，藏不下一个成年人。但这并不能解释哈伯德太太关于门闩的说法。",
        "nextNodeId": "hubbard_latch_notice"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notice_hubbard_latch_failure_bell",
      "node": {
