    },
    {
      "id": "node28",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "这以后，你听见雷切特先生房里有什么声响吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "node29"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node29",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "很难说──他在打呼噜，响极了。前天晚上闹得我一刻也不安宁。",
        "nextNodeId": "node30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node30",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "哈伯德太太，你可记得阿姆斯特朗拐骗案？",
        "nextNodeId": "node31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node31",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "记得，当然记得。这个坏蛋竟然还给他漏了网！阿，我真想亲手宰了他！",
        "nextNodeId": "node32"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node32",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "他可逃不了啦，他死了。昨天晚上死的，雷切特就是他。",
        "nextNodeId": "node33"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node33",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "好阿，想想看，这该多好。我非写信告诉我的女儿不可。昨天晚上我不是跟你说过，这人有一副可恶的面孔？瞧，我说对了。我的女儿老是说，只要妈妈一猜，你尽管押上全部的钱，准保会赢。",
        "nextNodeId": "node34"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node34",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "你跟阿姆斯特朗一家认识吗，哈伯德太太？",
        "nextNodeId": "node35"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node35",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "不认识。他们家进进出出的尽是有身份的人家。不过我听过，阿姆斯特朗太太是个讨人喜欢的女人，她的丈夫很敬重她。",
        "nextNodeId": "node36"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node36",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "哈伯德太太，你帮了我们的大忙──说真的很大的忙。",
        "nextNodeId": "node37"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node37",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "顺便问一句，你有鲜红色的丝睡衣？",
        "nextNodeId": "node38"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node38",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "老天爷，问得多奇怪！怎么会有呢！我身边有两件睡衣──一件是粉红色的法兰绒的，坐般时穿起来挺舒服。还有一件是我女儿送给我的礼物──紫色的，丝的，在家里时穿。可是你为什么问我的睡衣？",
        "nextNodeId": "node39"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node39",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "是这么一回事，太太。有一个穿鲜红睡衣的，昨天晚上到过你的包房或雷切特先生的包房。正如你刚才所说的那样，那时全部房门都关着，这样就很难弄明白究竟是哪个包房。",
        "nextNodeId": "node40"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node40",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "可是没什么穿红睡衣的人到过我的包房。",
        "nextNodeId": "node41"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node41",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "那必然是到雷切特先生的包房去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "node42"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node42",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "或许吧，这我可不清楚。",
        "nextNodeId": "node49"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node49",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "system",
        "speakerName": "系统",
        "text": "波洛帮太太收拾东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "node50"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node50",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "poirot",
        "speakerName": "波洛",
        "text": "你的手帕掉了，太太。",
        "nextNodeId": "node51"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node51",
      "node": {
        "nodeType": "dialogue",
        "speakerCharacterId": "mrs_hubbard",
        "speakerName": "哈伯德太太",
        "text": "这不是我的，波洛先生。我的帕上绣着C·M·H三个字母，而且都是些很合用的普普通通的大路货──不是高档的巴黎来的稀罕玩意儿。这么精细的帕谁配得上用？",
        "nextNodeId": "END"
      }
    }
  ]
